WEBVTT

00:30.095 --> 00:34.031
(Azure Spring)

00:34.032 --> 00:36.567
(All characters, places, events, etc. depicted are fictional.)

00:36.568 --> 00:38.970
(Children and animals were filmed under strict guidelines.)

00:48.613 --> 00:50.182
He killed someone?

00:57.956 --> 01:00.692
It's probably some nonsense he said because he was drunk.

01:56.882 --> 02:02.888
(Episode 5: How to Determine the End)

02:55.807 --> 02:58.610
He must've been a soldier.

03:07.319 --> 03:09.987
(Gun Accident in the Special Forces Guard Post)

03:09.988 --> 03:11.622
(1 Dead, 1 Critically Injured)

03:11.623 --> 03:13.543
"Gun accident in the special forces guard post."

03:16.361 --> 03:18.296
(Staff Sergeant Yoon Faces 3 Years in Prison)

03:19.698 --> 03:20.832
"Three years..."

03:21.233 --> 03:22.334
"Critically injured"?

03:25.637 --> 03:28.573
Yoon? Could it be...

03:29.808 --> 03:30.976
Yoon Duk Hyun?

03:36.615 --> 03:39.918
I thought you went out to feed the cats.

03:40.652 --> 03:43.021
Yes, but I left my phone here.

03:45.991 --> 03:49.327
I also couldn't find my phone, so I've been looking.

03:50.395 --> 03:52.329
I'm sorry if that upset you.

03:52.330 --> 03:53.331
Did you see it?

04:04.075 --> 04:07.646
Is the Yoon here, who allegedly killed someone,

04:09.714 --> 04:11.216
referring to you?

04:15.987 --> 04:17.255
It's not, is it?

04:18.990 --> 04:21.759
If it isn't you, just tell me so.

04:21.760 --> 04:24.296
Don't leave me with the wrong idea.

04:24.996 --> 04:25.997
It isn't.

04:28.233 --> 04:29.353
It's not a misunderstanding.

04:33.772 --> 04:35.340
I was in prison for three years...

04:37.342 --> 04:38.543
for killing someone.

04:42.981 --> 04:44.182
Why...

04:46.117 --> 04:47.319
did you kill him?

04:49.287 --> 04:50.755
Because he deserved to die.

05:11.276 --> 05:12.277
Hey.

05:12.911 --> 05:13.912
Hey!

05:14.779 --> 05:16.114
What are you doing?

05:16.481 --> 05:18.083
You seemed uncomfortable.

05:18.950 --> 05:20.018
No...

05:21.620 --> 05:22.921
It wasn't that.

05:25.757 --> 05:27.659
I could tell by your eyes.

05:34.199 --> 05:35.559
You can throw away my diving suit.

05:36.902 --> 05:38.870
Where are you going, Duk Hyun?

05:39.571 --> 05:42.807
Wait, are you leaving for good? All of a sudden?

05:42.974 --> 05:44.575
What's with him?

05:44.576 --> 05:47.278
Duk Hyun, are you really leaving?

05:47.279 --> 05:48.747
Duk Hyun!

05:54.886 --> 05:57.956
Who's this guy?

05:58.323 --> 05:59.391
What do you think?

06:00.592 --> 06:01.760
I'm with her.

06:02.527 --> 06:05.597
You had an older brother?

06:08.600 --> 06:09.734
Cha Jae Hun.

06:10.502 --> 06:12.470
- What brings you here? - Surprised?

06:13.471 --> 06:14.511
I'm surprised myself, too.

06:15.907 --> 06:18.543
I can't believe I came to this hick town to see you.

06:19.277 --> 06:20.579
Man.

06:21.279 --> 06:23.949
I, Cha Jae Hun, must love you a lot, An Na.

06:25.917 --> 06:27.285
What are you waiting for? Pack up.

06:31.223 --> 06:33.058
I'll let you start all over again.

06:33.792 --> 06:34.893
Swimming.

06:56.014 --> 06:58.416
(Jung Gi Tae)

07:01.319 --> 07:03.587
- Hey. - What's going on?

07:03.588 --> 07:05.222
When I woke up, you were gone.

07:05.223 --> 07:07.092
And so is that diver girl.

07:08.393 --> 07:09.394
Enough.

07:11.897 --> 07:13.265
Did you two run away together?

07:13.698 --> 07:15.734
I did run away, but I don't know about her.

07:16.868 --> 07:18.348
Did she hear what you said yesterday?

07:19.804 --> 07:22.240
Me? What did I say?

07:23.975 --> 07:26.511
Man, I always talk nonsense when I'm drunk.

07:29.181 --> 07:30.315
It wasn't nonsense.

07:35.987 --> 07:37.689
His death is practically on me.

07:53.038 --> 07:55.540
She must be quite disappointed.

08:04.182 --> 08:06.718
I am disappointed...

08:08.587 --> 08:09.688
in myself.

08:12.991 --> 08:15.092
- Jae Hun. - Hey. Hello?

08:15.093 --> 08:16.933
- Did you really go there to get An Na? - Yes.

08:17.929 --> 08:19.096
Why would you go after her?

08:19.097 --> 08:21.833
You said you'd stop two-timing and only date me.

08:23.635 --> 08:26.771
A return match between two former youth rivals.

08:27.105 --> 08:28.665
It makes for a great story, doesn't it?

08:29.541 --> 08:32.009
What are you going to do if I lose?

08:32.010 --> 08:34.112
That's never going to happen.

08:37.215 --> 08:38.983
I know An Na's swimming skills,

08:38.984 --> 08:40.504
and she has nothing on you, Ye Gyeong.

08:42.854 --> 08:45.290
Whatever. You figure it out, okay?

08:47.592 --> 08:49.895
Darn it. Why is she being such a nuisance?

09:01.840 --> 09:04.809
Let's start over, An Na.

09:09.447 --> 09:10.715
How ridiculous.

09:11.816 --> 09:13.985
I already know what Cha Jae Hun is like,

09:16.454 --> 09:18.557
yet I returned immediately the moment he said...

09:19.124 --> 09:20.759
I could start swimming again.

09:39.878 --> 09:41.847
It's as if the days I spent...

09:42.280 --> 09:44.049
in Parang-ri meant nothing.

10:20.385 --> 10:21.920
That must've been over three minutes.

10:22.354 --> 10:24.034
I held it for a while this time, didn't I?

10:29.828 --> 10:31.830
It's not about how long you can hold your breath.

10:34.232 --> 10:36.801
Then why are we doing this training?

10:37.903 --> 10:40.805
To determine the end of your breath.

10:42.274 --> 10:44.676
There's more to diving than holding your breath underwater.

10:45.944 --> 10:47.212
You must know where it ends...

10:49.114 --> 10:50.982
to let go, come up, and save yourself.

10:56.488 --> 10:57.722
It's as if everything...

10:58.790 --> 11:00.158
Yoon Duk Hyun said...

11:01.726 --> 11:02.794
also did not...

11:04.529 --> 11:05.764
mean anything.

11:31.356 --> 11:32.591
(Seafood Ramyeon)

11:38.463 --> 11:41.566
This isn't seafood ramyeon, but seafood-scented ramyeon.

11:47.973 --> 11:48.974
What...

11:49.641 --> 11:51.041
Gosh.

11:51.042 --> 11:53.644
(Best before September 16th, 2024)

11:53.645 --> 11:54.646
The end.

11:56.281 --> 11:59.084
Who gets to determine that?

12:55.407 --> 12:58.577
Darn it. Do we have to do this for Nam Sang Ho, too?

12:59.211 --> 13:01.145
It's not for him. It's for Jae Hui.

13:01.146 --> 13:03.315
But I'm the superior, not him.

13:05.450 --> 13:07.085
Come on.

13:08.453 --> 13:09.813
Ready or not, rock-paper-scissors.

13:12.724 --> 13:14.092
Go now. Make them again.

13:17.662 --> 13:19.029
Darn it.

13:19.030 --> 13:20.932
- Make it quick! - Shut it.

13:27.639 --> 13:30.308
Don't you see I have a freaking gun in my hand?

13:31.276 --> 13:32.277
Hey, look.

13:32.511 --> 13:35.580
- Please stop. - Scared, aren't you?

13:36.481 --> 13:39.184
- Please stop. - Stop what?

13:41.653 --> 13:42.988
That is dangerous.

13:43.522 --> 13:45.162
Yes, you're in freaking danger right now.

13:45.557 --> 13:48.260
Bang! And this will create a hole in your head.

13:49.160 --> 13:52.230
So why won't you freaking listen while I'm being nice?

13:56.334 --> 13:59.704
I told you to stop bullying him, didn't I?

14:01.173 --> 14:03.842
Why are you so obsessed with harassing Jae Hui?

14:04.643 --> 14:05.710
Why?

14:07.345 --> 14:10.782
Did you ask why? There's no freaking reason.

14:11.149 --> 14:12.284
It's fun.

14:14.953 --> 14:16.421
You evil jerk.

14:17.389 --> 14:18.523
Die.

14:19.157 --> 14:20.225
Die!

14:56.328 --> 14:58.429
Jae Hui... Jae Hui, no!

14:58.430 --> 14:59.531
No, Jae Hui.

14:59.931 --> 15:00.932
Jae Hui.

15:02.033 --> 15:03.034
Jae Hui...

15:03.335 --> 15:04.703
Jae Hui, no.

15:05.170 --> 15:07.905
No, Jae Hui...

15:07.906 --> 15:09.774
What the heck are you waiting for? Get help!

15:11.343 --> 15:12.410
Jae Hui.

15:20.685 --> 15:21.686
Gi Tae!

15:22.487 --> 15:23.788
Jung Gi Tae!

15:27.025 --> 15:28.126
What's going on?

15:30.295 --> 15:31.663
Jae Hui... Jae Hui!

16:33.558 --> 16:34.893
You nasty girl.

16:35.327 --> 16:38.263
Ten years ago and even now, you haven't changed one bit.

16:38.797 --> 16:39.865
Traitor.

16:46.071 --> 16:47.339
Perhaps...

16:49.040 --> 16:50.675
we do not know where our end is,

16:51.042 --> 16:53.122
and that must be why we're holding on for dear life,

17:19.638 --> 17:21.907
not realising we've already run out of breath.

17:31.016 --> 17:32.050
Goodness.

17:32.517 --> 17:34.997
I thought you had fled. Turns out you're waging a full-on war.

17:37.189 --> 17:39.057
Hey, wake up.

17:40.625 --> 17:41.626
Let's eat.

18:00.445 --> 18:02.112
What has gotten into you?

18:02.113 --> 18:03.515
I thought you'd never come here.

18:04.482 --> 18:06.282
I came now, so I wouldn't have to come again.

18:07.586 --> 18:10.555
You always pick out the worst things to say.

18:12.490 --> 18:14.325
Remember that day on the island?

18:14.326 --> 18:16.461
You asked why I was so hung up on you.

18:16.928 --> 18:17.929
Did I?

18:20.265 --> 18:21.499
Because I...

18:23.335 --> 18:25.103
still can't forget the things...

18:26.905 --> 18:28.240
that Jae Hui said.

18:34.946 --> 18:37.282
Take your time, man. I won't take it from you.

18:38.049 --> 18:39.718
It's so delicious.

18:41.753 --> 18:44.489
He's really not the Special Forces type.

18:45.090 --> 18:46.091
Don't you agree?

18:46.458 --> 18:47.958
There's no particular type for that.

18:47.959 --> 18:50.762
People get used to this life and make progress.

18:51.530 --> 18:52.564
Gosh.

18:56.234 --> 18:58.470
Actually, I...

19:00.438 --> 19:02.574
joined the Special Forces because I wanted to change.

19:07.512 --> 19:09.681
I didn't want to live like this anymore.

19:11.516 --> 19:12.817
What's so bad about you?

19:13.552 --> 19:15.387
Your bullies are the ones who did wrong.

19:16.521 --> 19:17.689
Even so,

19:19.791 --> 19:21.960
nothing would change if I didn't do anything.

19:27.065 --> 19:28.233
I should...

19:29.267 --> 19:30.735
at least try.

19:41.913 --> 19:44.282
I want to pull you back out into the world,

19:47.552 --> 19:49.221
and nothing would change if I sat around.

19:51.323 --> 19:52.490
That is why...

19:53.258 --> 19:56.061
I'm doing my best to try to convince you.

20:03.535 --> 20:04.975
I'm sorry for doing this every time.

20:05.203 --> 20:07.239
I don't have a bank account.

20:08.106 --> 20:09.207
That's a lot.

20:09.875 --> 20:11.376
Are you making a lump sum payment?

20:12.277 --> 20:13.778
This is the last time.

20:14.479 --> 20:15.880
You've been coming for two years,

20:15.881 --> 20:17.749
but you went inside for the first time, right?

20:18.483 --> 20:19.818
Many people do that.

20:20.285 --> 20:23.088
It's not easy to face someone you love in such pain.

20:25.323 --> 20:27.592
Well, something like that.

20:28.894 --> 20:30.195
What was it like?

20:34.332 --> 20:36.201
Didn't he say, "What took you so long?"

20:42.340 --> 20:43.642
Come again.

20:43.975 --> 20:45.977
We only accept a month's payment at a time.

20:54.219 --> 20:56.987
I'm sorry. Please handle this for me.

20:56.988 --> 20:59.891
(Haedam Convalescent Hospital)

21:28.086 --> 21:29.387
I commend you for your courage.

21:30.488 --> 21:31.857
It's not about being courageous.

21:32.324 --> 21:33.858
I came to see where my end is.

21:33.859 --> 21:36.127
- What the heck are you saying? - Settle down.

21:36.528 --> 21:37.796
Stop chatting.

21:38.530 --> 21:41.099
Let's start with a quick warm-up. Get ready.

21:55.814 --> 21:56.815
Hey.

21:57.516 --> 21:59.617
I heard you brought her back here.

21:59.618 --> 22:01.553
- Are you kidding me? - Why not?

22:02.721 --> 22:04.356
You had a thing for An Na, too.

22:04.756 --> 22:07.726
Well, she's nice to look at.

22:08.159 --> 22:10.427
But she has such a feisty personality.

22:10.428 --> 22:12.464
Then just look at her.

22:12.931 --> 22:14.291
If she's eye candy, that's enough.

22:15.066 --> 22:16.134
Should I do that?

22:20.205 --> 22:21.473
Gosh, my heart is racing.

22:22.974 --> 22:25.342
Anyway, do you plan to let An Na...

22:25.343 --> 22:26.745
get back into swimming?

22:28.046 --> 22:29.214
No way.

22:30.081 --> 22:32.350
She doesn't have what it takes to be an athlete.

22:33.218 --> 22:36.655
Ye Gyeong hadn't been stepping up her game lately,

22:37.355 --> 22:38.657
so it was to push her too.

22:39.858 --> 22:40.859
"Too"?

22:41.359 --> 22:42.394
It's been a while,

22:43.228 --> 22:44.863
so I want to get in her pants, too.

22:47.465 --> 22:50.402
Man, you're trash.

22:51.136 --> 22:54.606
Ye Gyeong is sexy, and An Na is cute.

22:55.173 --> 22:56.675
They're both my types.

23:02.113 --> 23:05.217
To be honest, I already knew...

23:06.117 --> 23:07.619
that this was the end for me.

23:19.831 --> 23:21.066
I just...

23:21.433 --> 23:23.101
haven't been able to let go.

23:57.636 --> 23:59.037
I could've harvested it quickly.

24:01.540 --> 24:02.807
And you could've died.

24:03.508 --> 24:05.076
You must let it go and come back up.

24:05.944 --> 24:07.078
That's how you'll live.

24:10.415 --> 24:11.850
Just as Duk Hyun said,

24:12.817 --> 24:15.687
will I live if I let this go?

24:19.991 --> 24:21.893
Even after I quit swimming,

24:22.928 --> 24:24.095
can I...

24:25.263 --> 24:26.431
really live on?

24:28.533 --> 24:31.269
Is one woman not enough for you?

24:32.771 --> 24:34.371
Can you do that with both of them?

24:34.372 --> 24:35.473
Hey, An Na.

24:35.907 --> 24:37.375
Why did you stop?

24:40.946 --> 24:43.248
Wait, where is she going? What?

24:47.352 --> 24:48.353
What's wrong?

24:51.189 --> 24:52.190
Are you unwell?

24:53.091 --> 24:54.159
Is it your shoulder?

24:54.492 --> 24:55.493
Darn it.

24:56.228 --> 24:57.429
What the...

24:58.697 --> 25:00.799
- Are you crazy? - Yes, I am crazy.

25:01.566 --> 25:03.735
You can't keep swimming if you treat me like this.

25:04.102 --> 25:05.270
I'm done, you jerk.

25:12.878 --> 25:14.012
Seo An Na, you...

25:15.213 --> 25:17.082
- Have you lost your mind? - What now?

25:19.651 --> 25:21.520
I didn't say anything.

25:23.054 --> 25:24.055
Darn it.

25:24.389 --> 25:25.824
Hey, wait. It hurts.

25:26.458 --> 25:29.127
I wasn't planning to sort this out with words, either.

25:31.129 --> 25:32.130
Hey, Ye Gyeong.

25:33.532 --> 25:35.066
If you keep flip-turning like that,

25:36.001 --> 25:37.235
you'll end up like me.

25:39.738 --> 25:40.839
Don't trust Coach Cha...

25:44.676 --> 25:45.777
too much.

26:02.594 --> 26:04.029
Gosh, I'm sorry.

26:04.696 --> 26:06.697
I'll try to find the next tenant,

26:06.698 --> 26:08.458
- so I'll pay one month's... - I understand.

26:08.733 --> 26:12.704
Anyway, why is a young person like you suddenly moving to the countryside?

26:16.975 --> 26:20.712
I must let everything go and go up to the surface before it's too late...

26:21.847 --> 26:23.215
to live.

26:26.685 --> 26:29.187
Yes, please do that.

26:30.021 --> 26:31.089
Thank you.

26:47.005 --> 26:48.006
Mom.

26:49.441 --> 26:50.876
Am I really doing...

26:51.877 --> 26:52.878
a good job?

26:53.812 --> 26:55.680
Why do you even ask?

27:02.821 --> 27:03.889
Goodness.

27:04.556 --> 27:06.757
You weren't the type who'd do or drop everything...

27:06.758 --> 27:08.326
as I suggested.

27:09.261 --> 27:11.062
You never listened.

27:13.431 --> 27:14.933
I wasn't like that.

27:16.968 --> 27:18.136
I told you, didn't I?

27:19.104 --> 27:22.707
It doesn't matter if the medal's gold or bronze.

27:23.775 --> 27:24.776
They're all the same.

27:25.477 --> 27:28.013
It doesn't matter whether you swim or not.

27:30.815 --> 27:32.684
You're Seo An Na, Cho Mi Hyeon's daughter.

27:33.151 --> 27:34.752
Live your life however you want to.

27:34.753 --> 27:37.422
Eat a good meal and keep yourself warm.

27:37.956 --> 27:38.957
Go live that life.

27:43.929 --> 27:46.965
I'll always be here to support you.

27:50.468 --> 27:52.504
Seo An Na, you can do it!

28:19.064 --> 28:23.001
Do your job right, Su Jeong. Please!

28:25.637 --> 28:27.072
I don't want to!

28:28.473 --> 28:32.010
I should've been the one to go to Seoul, not An Na!

28:35.080 --> 28:36.481
It's not too late.

28:43.088 --> 28:45.223
What's going on? Why are you back already?

28:45.590 --> 28:47.192
Yes, I'm back.

28:56.368 --> 28:57.435
Have you been well?

29:09.181 --> 29:10.215
After everything,

29:11.816 --> 29:13.084
I'm back in Parang-ri.

29:16.121 --> 29:18.990
But this time, it's different.

29:26.598 --> 29:28.466
I'm now back on the surface.

29:35.173 --> 29:37.342
That means I'm ready to dive back in.

29:38.944 --> 29:40.045
I'm hungry.

30:27.726 --> 30:30.328
You're here, too.

30:32.197 --> 30:33.265
Have you been...

30:34.533 --> 30:35.967
waiting for me?

30:39.604 --> 30:41.973
I came because I had one last thing to say.

30:49.247 --> 30:51.349
If it's an explanation about your past,

30:52.050 --> 30:53.051
I don't want to hear it.

30:54.219 --> 30:55.554
I didn't look it up,

30:56.888 --> 30:58.156
and I'm not curious.

30:59.457 --> 31:00.759
If you really were a bad person,

31:02.160 --> 31:03.880
the police would've taken you away already.

31:08.934 --> 31:10.168
Above all,

31:13.705 --> 31:14.973
you don't owe me an apology...

31:16.908 --> 31:18.310
or need my forgiveness for it.

31:29.688 --> 31:30.722
You should...

31:33.191 --> 31:34.492
go back to swimming.

31:39.297 --> 31:41.099
I came because I wanted to tell you that.

31:44.469 --> 31:46.605
Can I really live on even after I quit swimming?

31:47.539 --> 31:48.673
I was afraid.

31:53.245 --> 31:55.113
You know you're being funny right now, right?

31:58.984 --> 32:01.486
I realised it as I watched you harvest seafood.

32:02.521 --> 32:03.722
You can start over.

32:04.656 --> 32:06.691
How dare an amateur judge an athlete?

32:10.362 --> 32:11.363
My apologies.

32:12.264 --> 32:13.665
I shouldn't have been so nosy.

32:16.034 --> 32:18.570
But I'm no longer afraid.

32:28.180 --> 32:29.781
I'm glad you look fine.

32:30.916 --> 32:31.983
Then, please excuse me.

32:35.887 --> 32:36.988
Do you want...

32:39.658 --> 32:40.792
to swim together?

32:48.600 --> 32:49.601
This time,

32:51.970 --> 32:53.238
I'll teach you.

33:01.613 --> 33:03.715
Because I know we have each other,

33:06.685 --> 33:08.053
who would willingly jump...

33:09.988 --> 33:11.156
into the water together.

33:35.514 --> 33:38.650
What? How did you find me here?

33:39.017 --> 33:43.121
Come on. I've been stalking Duk Hyun for three years.

33:43.622 --> 33:46.992
Finding a well-known swimmer was a piece of cake.

33:49.160 --> 33:50.795
What do you want?

33:54.466 --> 33:56.434
It's about Yoon Duk Hyun.

33:57.002 --> 33:59.070
It seemed like he returned to that island.

34:01.173 --> 34:03.808
He left without looking back. I doubt it.

34:05.510 --> 34:06.745
I'm certain.

34:08.246 --> 34:09.281
So,

34:09.948 --> 34:11.149
when you meet him again,

34:13.285 --> 34:14.286
make sure...

34:15.587 --> 34:17.055
you pull him out of the water.

34:22.761 --> 34:24.462
I noticed him smiling...

34:26.631 --> 34:28.099
when he was with you.

34:30.735 --> 34:31.770
My goodness!

34:32.938 --> 34:33.939
Hey!

